{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T17:27:13.194Z","ordinal":36545,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a08c5b-fa2a-72c1-be2f-59a0c309ed44","author":"/root/simple_review_tui","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/simple_review_tui\nPayload:\nImplemented the simplified review TUI in:\n\n- `internal/tui/quality_review.go`\n- `internal/tui/quality_review_test.go`\n\nBehavior now:\n\n- No visual queue pane or context/details/rationale flow.\n- One scrollable statement screen with filter decision and a compact panel.\n- Only judges with a valid `Position` render:\n  - `AGREES WITH FILTER`\n  - `DISAGREES WITH FILTER`\n  - `UNSURE`\n- Fixed bottom action bar:\n  - default: agree/disagree\n  - split panel: filter correct yes/no\n  - arrows + Enter or y/n; x skips; q quits.\n- Save occurs immediately; no confirmation screen.\n\nNew adapter API:\n\n```go\ntype QualityReviewSaveFunc func(itemID, answer string) error\n\ntype QualityReviewItem struct {\n    PanelSummary string\n    Question     string\n    AnswerKind   QualityReviewAnswerKind\n    Judges       []QualityReviewJudge\n}\n\nconst (\n    QualityReviewPanelAgreement // answer: agree | disagree\n    QualityReviewFilterCorrect  // answer: yes | no\n)\n\ntype QualityReviewJudge struct {\n    Name     string\n    Position string // agrees_with_filter | disagrees_with_filter | unsure\n    Why      string\n}\n```\n\nTests cover rendering/omission, immediate save, arrows + Enter, split-panel yes/no, save failures, scrolling/resizing, skip/quit, and terminal-control sanitization.\n\nValidation: `go test ./internal/tui` passes. A fresh `go test ./internal/cli` currently needs the CLI adapter migrated from the former five-argument callback to `func(itemID, answer string) error`."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08c52-627e-72c2-ad24-e4d4de487a71"}}}
