reserve the existing silent quality gate: most candidate cards should still\n598:- `empty`: the quality gate emitted no fact for this candidate;\n647:  let the quality gate reject it; do not assign human authority by default.\n677:Candidate generation is a high-recall admission filter. A match means \"worth\n678:asking the quality gate,\" not \"write a fact.\"\n700:### Negative admission signals\n728:Use an inspectable integer score. Do not hide admission behind a learned model.\n753:Build the smallest window that lets the quality gate judge resolution and\n793:highest authority prior. They still pass the durable-fact quality gate for\n1320:quality gate offline during evaluation. Review any fact it emits that candidate\n1324:### Fact-quality gates\n1424:### Phase 2: Candidate-pack extraction, shadow only\n1433:Exit gate: candidate and fact-quality gates pass on the full labeled corpus;\n1451:tracked separately by the still-open Phase 2 quality gate.\n"},"started_at_ms":1789063025706,"completed_at_ms":1789063025706}}
