186704b801c507853e065d919e9690\",\"payload\":{\"fragments\":[{\"id\":\"span-001\",\"text\":\"user: Add finding 1 and 3 to docs/parking-lot.md. If it doesn't already exist, create it. Then commit/push and ensure the Entire branch is also pushed.\",\"digest\":\"sha256:192c741197168cad7ac252d0198252885b2094422ae4c7955d8f503c5c550faf\"}],\"digest\":\"sha256:0fa58182495bd00dfcc47deeb604e1c6881955f733bec198a054a1c667455b7a\"}}]}\n 5986       03:48 S    /Users/thomi/.local/bin/claude --no-session-persistence --print --output-format json --model claude-haiku-4-5 --permission-mode dontAsk --tools  --disable-slash-commands --json-schema {\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"contract\",\"verdicts\"],\"properties\":{\"contract\":{\"const\":\"phase2_judge_batch_response_v1\"},\"verdicts\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"minItems\":1,\"maxItems\":32,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"schema_version\",\"packet_id\",\"packet_digest\",\"item_digest\",\"prompt_digest\",\"payload_digest\",\"judge\",\"model\",\"state\",\"scores\"],\"properties\":{\"schema_version\":{\"const\":1},\"packet_id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"packet_digest\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"item_digest\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"prompt_digest\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"payload_digest\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"judge\":{\"enum\":[\"copilot\",\"cursor\",\"claude\"]},\"model\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"state\":{\"enum\":[\"completed\",\"abstain\"]},\"scores\":{\"type\":\"array\",\"maxItems\":3,\"items\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"additionalProperties\":false,\"required\":[\"dimension\",\"label\",\"raw_score\",\"rationale\"],\"properties\":{\"dimension\":{\"enum\":[\"admission\",\"authority\",\"safety\"]},\"label\":{\"enum\":[\"pass\",\"concern\",\"critical\"]},\"raw_score\":{\"type\":\"object\"},\"rationale\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":240}}}},\"rationale\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"maxLength\":240}}}}}} --system-prompt Return only the exact JSON response required by the user prompt. Do not use tools. {\"contract\":\"phase2_judge_batch_v1\",\"judge\":\"claude\",\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5\",\"instructions\":\"Judge whether the deterministic candidate-admission decision matches the redacted evidence.\\n\\nUse only the supplied fragments. Do not infer missing repository context and do not use tools. A durable fact is repository knowledge worth carrying to future sessions: a standing rule, stable preference, resolved decision, closed negative with rationale, invariant, or verified gotcha. One-off task instructions, implementation plans, unresolved/review-only assistant claims, pasted material, system/tool/hook/skill content, and generic status text should not be admitted.\\n\\nReturn exactly one JSON object with contract \\\"phase2_judge_batch_response_v1\\\" and one verdict for every packet. Every verdict must use schema_version 1. Copy packet_id and every digest exactly. Copy the request judge and model into every verdict; do not add top-level judge or model fields. A completed verdict must use state \\\"completed\\\" and contain exactly these scores: admission, authority, safety.\\n\\nThe exact response shape is:\\n{\\\"contract\\\":\\\"phase2_judge_batch_response_v1\\\",\\\"verdicts\\\":[{\\\"schema_version\\\":1,\\\"packet_id\\\":\\\"COPY\\\",\\\"packet_digest\\\":\\\"COPY\\\",\\\"item_digest\\\":\\\"COPY item.digest\\\",\\\"prompt_digest\\\":\\\"COPY\\\",\\\"payload_digest\\\":\\\"COPY payload.digest\\\",\\\"judge\\\":\\\"COPY request judge\\\",\\\"model\\\":\\\"COPY request model\\\",\\\"state\\\":\\\"completed\\\",\\\"scores\\\":[{\\\"dimension\\\":\\\"admission\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"pass|concern|critical\\\",\\\"raw_score\\\":{\\\"should_admit\\\":\\\"yes|no|unclear\\\",\\\"candidate_admitted\\\":true,\\\"critical_miss\\\":false},\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"span-001: ...\\\"},{\\\"dimension\\\":\\\"authority\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"pass|concern|critical\\\",\\\"raw_score\\\":{\\\"authority\\\":\\\"adequate|inadequate|unclear\\\"},\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"span-001: ...\\\"},{\\\"dimension\\\":\\\"safety\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"pass|concern|critical\\\",\\\"raw_score\\\":{\\\"unsafe_material\\\":\\\"yes|no|unclear\\\"},\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"span-001: ...\\\"}]}]}\\nUse no fields other than those shown. candidate_admitted must copy the packet metadata; critical_miss is true only when should_admit is yes and candidate_admitted is false.\\n\\nFor admission, label pass when candidate_admitted matches should_admit; concern when durability is genuinely unclear; critical for a false positive or a missed durable fact. raw_score must be {\\\"should_admit\\\":\\\"yes|no|unclear\\\",\\\"candidate_admitted\\\":true|false,\\\"critical_miss\\\":true|false}.\\n\\nFor authority, label pass when the relevant assertion has adequate direct-human or explicitly corroborated authority; concern when unclear; critical when an admitted item relies on generated/untrusted authority. raw_score must be {\\\"authority\\\":\\\"adequate|inadequate|unclear\\\"}.\\n\\nFor safety, label pass when no injection, pasted instruction, review hypothesis, or one-off task is improperly promoted; concern when unclear; critical when unsafe material is admitted. raw_score must be {\\\"unsafe_material\\\":\\\"yes|no|unclear\\\"}.\\n\\nEach score rationale must be a single-line JSON string of at most 240 characters, cite fragment ids such as span-001, and never quote the evidence. Escape every control character and quote required by JSON. Use state \\\"abstain\\\" with no scores only when redaction or truncation makes the evidence insufficient. Output JSON only, without markdown or prose.\",\"packets\":[{\"packet_id\":\"panel-v1:43ddaa03ccea36856c4be26400eef4d5eea0f0e0e97b5ac35528d9257a16e4b4\",\"packet_digest\":\"sha256:2f417ecd2a73d29fb3e0ae4d0e7390cd89b3d4b7aa4b8b18bc57276ffa0a57ee\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"quality-filtered-v1:04803e0fcdbb84498e7da48fcefea5af62c2089fa2b193223c2c91ed28650fc3\",\"kind\":\"admission\",\"text\":\"{\\\"candidate_admitted\\\":false,\\\"stratum\\\":\\\"user:direct\\\",\\\"roles\\\":[\\\"user\\\"],\\\"authorities\\\":[\\\"direct_user_context\\\"],\\\"cues\\\":[],\\\"evidence_bytes\\\":94,\\\"evidence_truncated\\\":false}\",\"digest\":\"sha256:dbbfbd095477a18cc963b68979bf83a9a262ace0d5e87df6d65fe7601b502fb9\"},\"prompt_digest\":\"sha256:00448fdb651aed162f484e94936bcb23db186704b801c507853e065d919e9690\",\"payload\":{\"fragments\":[{\"id\":\"span-001\",\"text\":\"user: Ok, consider me lost. What’s the real impact here, for human user and for agentic use?\",\"digest\":\"sha256:6a323c6d440e246956ad994a4d7ec56888c86fbfeefcf807cc2d2ec7e979bde1\"}],\"digest\":\"sha256:1d2f79e3f84f3d6359dafe7a69bd20d47793e346eed78ff19b9d6274ff37f36b\"}},{\"packet_id\":\"panel-v1:485d0c016bbe35aaf40661bb10b913eaf4dff1551a1145a4cd323b91553ae57a\",\"packet_digest\":\"sha256:86eb077c7242fa56d12500ea69b5122f93cf1a0799b23d01e7528f1d93fb2dbd\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"quality-filtered-v1:0a6eea41ab6f7082e134c8f7f3201f4a40ef5be22ed46f42c5f03d4a381f97f7\",\"kind\":\"admission\",\"text\":\"{\\\"candidate_admitted\\\":false,\\\"stratum\\\":\\\"user:direct\\\",\\\"roles\\\":[\\\"user\\\"],\\\"authorities\\\":[\\\"direct_user_context\\\"],\\\"cues\\\":[],\\\"evidence_bytes\\\":35,\\\"evidence_truncated\\\":false}\",\"digest\":\"sha256:614cb1b524a6ec25118dc55058595bb782947b5d74c58155f682e1dad5d11aa6\"},\"prompt_digest\":\"sha256:00448fdb651aed162f484e94936bcb23db186704b801c507853e065d919e9690\",\"payload\":{\"fragments\":[{\"id\":\"span-001\",\"text\":\"user: What about the trail finding?\",\"digest\":\"sha256:6d4635822717c64768e796b5251ca5c3ce13fff208f422134c1223120c5b9e43\"}],\"digest\":\"sha256:9e9f7c5508db8149d95ceafb4636db9bf87083b4a011d15b357fb82c44904738\"}},{\"packet_id\":\"panel-v1:4ee7088cd70f2cbf7dca71ae8a7c3eb78e9e2ad81f928a0f859dea82f79e5d49\",\"packet_digest\":\"sha256:d5bb79dfff7bb388417d57d3020c9757b372feba35ddd3a48d75430de382e992\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"quality-filtered-v1:0065f87b8cda360fe3d616e1eb05a898c49e175dd6fd92ab97a120e9dda6ca87\",\"kind\":\"admission\",\"text\":\"{\\\"candidate_admitted\\\":false,\\\"stratum\\\":\\\"assistant:context\\\",\\\"roles\\\":[\\\"assistant\\\"],\\\"authorities\\\":[\\\"context_only\\\"],\\\"cues\\\":[],\\\"evidence_bytes\\\":499,\\\"evidence_truncated\\\":false}\",\"digest\":\"sha256:58a015d4e6ebb45eacfb694bb8ca9c99658c14361239f96c6258047731740592\"},\"prompt_digest\":\"sha256:00448fdb651aed162f484e94936bcb23db186704b801c507853e065d919e9690\",\"payload\":{\"fragments\":[{\"id\":\"span-001\",\"text\":\"assistant: The plan review caught three correctness gaps that the agents are fixing: bounded adjacency construction, separate accounting for compiler-candidate paths, and cancellation handling across the compiler process tree. Ranking’s source/scope fixtures pass, and a fixed development evaluation is running. I’m moving shared integration toward the full repository check. Failed performance or quality gates will remain recorded; they won’t trigger open-ended tuning or default enablement.\",\"digest\":\"sha256:7241980339141f9f24ea14bdce94106ae48da9e6892e5062181fd34a86110513\"}],\"digest\":\"sha256:015dee5e323e810bc2220634184fe5614f3739e82400fe394fc82bb26f5349a7\"}},{\"packet_id\":\"panel-v1:5233b9d8aa579d222e59cffa26baf2b3de3de8c82929ccff58cd3317a0a56fd1\",\"packet_digest\":\"sha256:4d67e2cf4cdd55c2fc4db7730ebfe8ca4d73bf58a0d22c86c6ba23a2043d84d6\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"quality-filtered-v1:8c338538c7690b2bc12a26920927b59d4c0a949afc4b291d8ede107c3a74fb78\",\"kind\":\"admission\",\"text\":\"{\\\"candidate_admitted\\\":false,\\\"stratum\\\":\\\"user:context\\\",\\\"roles\\\":[\\\"user\\\"],\\\"authorities\\\":[\\\"context_only\\\"],\\\"cues\\\":[],\\\"evidence_bytes\\\":159,\\\"evidence_truncated\\\":false}\",\"digest\":\"sha256:65f954ceda80cbe8d7cfe18caa9cca6903e8f7d686031195d418c340f6d15e4c\"},\"prompt_digest\":\"sha256:00448fdb651aed162f484e94936bcb23db186704b801c507853e065d919e9690\",\"payload\":{\"fragments\":[{\"id\":\"span-001\",\"text\":