 it is the next push to that branch — which will happen naturally when someone takes #97 out of draft, or I can push a trivial commit if you'd rather force it now. The other independent check is still available too: `! cursor-agent login` and I'll run an outside review of the diff.\",\"digest\":\"sha256:8e1949c22b0ee6b665ec759619b3b823f9f778aea6ee0c609573a5d18980522e\"}],\"digest\":\"sha256:b20eee97594fbcbbadb6eaa1f9f33697463be46fd664421a38eced5cc34fd52f\"}},{\"packet_id\":\"panel-v1:11e0db7d716d45c4cea1b1700d1de3082b15fa228871681b38c60d81d58a43a7\",\"packet_digest\":\"sha256:353cc0ffa83430df43520398eb1f49637ab22f5d7594fdd4c877a85df95378ae\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"quality-admitted-v1:f6df80b81ff744c81fc4ed934a83e8b498f8b45c8c4fcb9c3daa0105ad4cbcf8\",\"kind\":\"admission\",\"text\":\"{\\\"candidate_admitted\\\":true,\\\"stratum\\\":\\\"admitted:direct_user:acceptance\\\",\\\"roles\\\":[\\\"user\\\"],\\\"authorities\\\":[\\\"direct_user\\\"],\\\"cues\\\":[\\\"acceptance\\\"],\\\"evidence_bytes\\\":1131,\\\"evidence_truncated\\\":false}\",\"digest\":\"sha256:80f3951b9a2c55bf1aece3ec7e03b5b1a9271ecf13fc089418c63799e998977f\"},\"prompt_digest\":\"sha256:00448fdb651aed162f484e94936bcb23db186704b801c507853e065d919e9690\",\"payload\":{\"fragments\":[{\"id\":\"span-001\",\"text\":\"assistant: You're signing with an SSH hardware key (`id_ed25519_c_sk`), and the agent refused — it likely needs a touch, or the key needs re-adding. Stage 1 is fully staged (9 files, +245/−5) and builds clean. Once your agent is ready, tell me and I'll retry — or run it yourself: ``` ! ssh-add ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_c_sk ``` Then I'll re-run the commit and continue with the remaining three stages: 2. `perf(sem): derive each symbol body and file's constants once` — `symbol_body.go`, `file_string_constants.go`, `types.go`, `provider.go`, `golden_test.go` 3. `perf(sem): hoist constant regexes to package vars` — 180 sites + 88 alias removals, `regexp_hoisting_test.go` 4. `perf(sem): resolve file relations in parallel` — `provider_parallel.go`, `provider.go`, `search_cache.go` Each stage gets a build + vet check before its commit, and I'll verify the final tree is byte-identical to the one I measured and race-tested (`diff` against my snapshot) once all four land — so the split history is provably the same code you saw the numbers for.\\nuser: go ahead\\nassistant: Signed. Now stage 2 — the per-body derivations.\",\"digest\":\"sha256:ff6224827b19db635831017fd1af3a7003b0bf442361ab0edd7229031e3ec6f3\"}],\"digest\":\"sha256:2cab1c246ecf7ac31d28d056694c13c260476a2d96e9a9cd2a320e2424c63c9e\"}},{\"packet_id\":\"panel-v1:15634b108f398c60c152c39ddbac3aea580ce6b26ae59231563d3f585f6aa7a2\",\"packet_digest\":\"sha256:5af44e2637d20c3965a996ac0d34fd0c6067f31861a84423ffdede02106d1084\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"quality-filtered-v1:01df73139cbd2038def6629e0c125f3436a5a3e6b374fa13d0baf780ca327ae6\",\"kind\":\"admission\",\"text\":\"{\\\"candidate_admitted\\\":false,\\\"stratum\\\":\\\"user:direct\\\",\\\"roles\\\":[\\\"user\\\"],\\\"authorities\\\":[\\\"direct_user_context\\\"],\\\"cues\\\":[],\\\"evidence_bytes\\\":51,\\\"evidence_truncated\\\":false}\",\"digest\":\"sha256:e2e3b890aa125b1e4b2111454d9719bc48ac9e186abdf61653a35b831d538e8d\"},\"prompt_digest\":\"sha256:00448fdb651aed162f484e94936bcb23db186704b801c507853e065d919e9690\",\"payload\":{\"fragments\":[{\"id\":\"span-001\",\"text\":\"user: Address the open findings in entire trail 122\",\"digest\":\"sha256:eb32a68999d7314c15b6ab2047e32b44baf1e1f5c94c14851dd48177ac6e4e80\"}],\"digest\":\"sha256:a4c49bd65beaa296c0af9d98d8ab089138f0351742fc1572b91b3b4dfd41d386\"}},{\"packet_id\":\"panel-v1:18393e9f17385200fcd403b8a01a3081b09f9de8c359d1852e56089cfff4d736\",\"packet_digest\":\"sha256:ae1f241f233c8cfd6de3c9dfe30657fd092e2f946d546c57b7de49302b8314dc\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"quality-admitted-v1:8b6b0821068238bcf3d7d007382da91d280e3d4ae51df76c20c463ae3b0fefcc\",\"kind\":\"admission\",\"text\":\"{\\\"candidate_admitted\\\":true,\\\"stratum\\\":\\\"ad