{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T20:33:16.117Z","ordinal":38273,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0200a-63d8-7b21-adef-c3850aecebf7","turn_id":"01a08d05-9960-7203-b218-368eb24fc42b","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_0873a68aa02aff8f016aa3140a3bb48198a16db618a5be8f3f","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’ll rewrite the plan around a strict new order: Sol/Terra/Luna implement, the main agent scopes and adjudicates, Claude/Copilot/Cursor score every intermediate phase, Astra resolves ties, and human scoring happens once—after all implementation and machine gates—as the final promotion gate. The earlier 20-item calibration will remain historical evidence, not an ongoing human checkpoint."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1789072394327,"completed_at_ms":1789072396117}}
