{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T20:40:49.850Z","ordinal":38378,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a08d0d-3bba-7f21-af27-b528331e5429","author":"/root/rework_plan_agentic_gates","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/rework_plan_agentic_gates\nPayload:\nApplied the bounded correction pass to [candidate_distillation_plan.md](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/docs/candidate_distillation_plan.md).\n\n- Resolver/artifacts are now explicitly planned workflow, not claimed current commands/files.\n- Astra receives all available primary verdicts and produces one digest-bound escalation judgment.\n- Restored Phase 3 relationship inspection as historical manual, supplemental evidence.\n- Renamed intermediate gold terminology to “sealed provisional evaluation corpus.”\n- Final Phase 5 human UI now specifies available judge/Astra scores and reasons, omitted unavailable judges, bounded resumable batches, second-human escalation only for ambiguous/critical cases, and software metric recomputation.\n- Corrected Stage 5: different-ID facts remain active/separate; only optional local neutral relationships, no executable proposal by default.\n- Main-agent phase judgment now explicitly reports performance, quality, and progress against plan.\n\nValidation: `git diff --check` passed; consistency searches found no stale intermediate-gold or obsolete agentic-resolution claims."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08d05-9960-7203-b218-368eb24fc42b"}}}
