{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T20:42:47.539Z","ordinal":38419,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"agent_message","id":"amsg_01a08d0f-0773-7e41-816a-2280c72f6b40","author":"/root/rework_plan_agentic_gates","recipient":"/root","content":[{"type":"input_text","text":"Message Type: FINAL_ANSWER\nTask name: /root\nSender: /root/rework_plan_agentic_gates\nPayload:\nFinal acceptance corrections applied to [candidate_distillation_plan.md](/Users/thomi/Projects/entire-brain/docs/candidate_distillation_plan.md).\n\n- Exact-only Stage 5 now keeps uncertain different-ID facts separate; neutral relationships are local/read-only/non-mutating, with no proposal workflow.\n- Supersession gate correctly states no automatic supersession or proposal in MVP.\n- Phase 5 humans label; software recomputes metrics.\n- Phase 3 exit is explicitly historical, with new deltas subject to the agentic policy.\n- Human rejection blocks promotion and permits only one consolidated, evidence-bound remediation plus affected-gate and changed-human-delta reruns.\n\n`git diff --check` passes."}],"internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08d05-9960-7203-b218-368eb24fc42b"}}}
