{"timestamp":"2026-09-10T20:45:24.490Z","ordinal":38493,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_0873a68aa02aff8f016aa316e14e5881989df367a60cfbc152","status":"completed","call_id":"call_DROrZOwn6YkobhIKV7FFcdf9","name":"exec","input":"const p = await tools.update_plan({explanation:\"The plan now uses cheap-model subagents for implementation, independent Claude/Copilot/Cursor scoring for all Phase 0–4 gates, Astra only for unresolved panel outcomes, and a single final human Phase 5 promotion gate. The document is validated, committed, and pushed.\",plan:[\n  {step:\"Map every current human/intermediate gate and rollout dependency in the plan\",status:\"completed\"},\n  {step:\"Rewrite execution roles and agentic scoring protocol\",status:\"completed\"},\n  {step:\"Move human scoring to the final Phase 5 gate and reconcile all conflicting sections\",status:\"completed\"},\n  {step:\"Validate the plan for internal consistency, then commit and push\",status:\"completed\"}\n]});\ntext(p);\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a08d05-9960-7203-b218-368eb24fc42b"}}}
